    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PojavLauncherTeam/android-openjdk-build-multiarch/tarball/jre8-40df388",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PojavLauncherTeam/android-openjdk-build-multiarch/zipball/jre8-40df388",
    "body": "**Note**: for future builds, please go to Actions: [OpenJDK 8](https://github.com/PojavLauncherTeam/android-openjdk-build-multiarch/actions?query=branch%3Ajre8-ios-jitjailed), [OpenJDK 17](https://github.com/PojavLauncherTeam/android-openjdk-build-multiarch/actions?query=branch%3Abuildjre17).\r\n\r\nThis is another Java Runtime used for PojavLauncher iOS that runs without jailbreaking the device. W^X JIT now works at full speed by swapping page permission when necessary. More info can be found in https://github.com/PojavLauncherTeam/openjdk-multiarch-jdk8u/commit/40df388626a5f7019088a83ae3f3d26f5cdd0f0e\r\nJRE17 for unjailbroken iOS is soon to be released.\r\n\r\nUpdate: fixed random crash issue",
